1,"commandHex":"0x3D","params":[87,0,1,181],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11056,"commandId":49,"commandHex":"0x31","params":[0,654,0,0,0,0,6],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11094,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[0,181,-1,0,1,0],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11120,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[1,181,-1,0,0,0],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11146,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[2,181,-1,0,0,1],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11172,"commandId":20,"commandHex":"0x14","params":["&유비\n장군, 동쪽에 먼지가 자욱하니\n도적이 나타난 듯합니다.\n적을 맞아 싸우도록 명해 주십시오."],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11269,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[181,226,-1,0,1,1],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11295,"commandId":20,"commandHex":"0x14","params":["&추정\n그게...\n적의 행방이 불분명하니\n섣불리 건드려 경계하게 해선 안 되네.\n\n&유비\n옳으신 말씀입니다만,\n도적을 토벌하러 온 우리가 어찌\n놈들의 횡포를 보고만 있겠습니까?\n\n&추정\n음, 세 사람은 기운이 넘치니\n휘하 병사를 이끌고 적을 유인하게.\n\n&추정\n나는 대군을 이끌고 여기 매복해\n힘을 비축하다 적이 지쳐 방심할 때\n치면 단번에 모조리 섬멸할 수 있네.\n\n&유비\n장군의 명을 받들겠습니다.\n\n&관우\n(관가에서 저런 겁쟁이 관리를\n장수로 쓰니 어찌 이기겠는가?)\n\n&장비\n(저 개 같은 관리가 겁먹고 빠지니\n차라리 잘됐군. 이 장비가\n실컷 죽여 주마!)"],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11822,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[0,226,-1,0,1,0],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11848,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[1,226,-1,0,0,0],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11874,"commandId":79,"commandHex":"0x4F","params":[2,226,-1,0,0,1],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11900,"commandId":93,"commandHex":"0x5D","params":[0,15],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset":11912,"commandId":25,"commandHex":"0x19","params":["승리 조건\n★·적군을 전멸시킨다.\n\n패배 조건\n☆·유비가 사망한다.\n☆·추정이 사망한다.\n☆·15턴을 초과한다."],"childCommandIds":[]},{"depth":1,"kind":"Body","offset